 MP","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/steve-reed","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/keir-starmer","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/keir-starmer","base_path":"/government/people/keir-starmer","content_id":"86d507f5-c34e-466b-b622-4d4585b75916","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-20T10:49:41Z","schema_name":"person","title":"The Rt Hon Sir Keir Starmer KCB KC MP","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/keir-starmer","withdrawn":false}],"primary_publishing_organisation":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1419","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","content_id":"1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649","details":{"acronym":"MHCLG","brand":"ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/668f9d9ea3c2a28abb50cd88/s960_2_Marsham_Street_1_-_960x640.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/668f9d9eab418ab055592384/s300_2_Marsham_Street_1_-_960x640.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Ministry of Housing,<br/>Communities &amp; <br/>Local Government"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Housing, Communities and Local Government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-environment-food-and-rural-affairs","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-environment-food-and-rural-affairs","base_path":"/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-environment-food-and-rural-affairs","content_id":"845e649f-c0f1-11e4-8223-005056011aef","details":{"body":"<p>The Secretary of State has overall responsibility for the Department for the Environment, Food and Rural Affairs.</p>\n\n<p>She has specific responsibilities for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>budget, including Official Development Assistance (<abbr title=\"Official Development Assistance\">ODA</abbr>)</li>\n  <li>international relations</li>\n  <li>senior appointments</li>\n  <li>economic growth</li>\n</ul>\n\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":22,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-20T12:24:30Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Secretary of State for Environment, Food and Rural Affairs","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-environment-food-and-rural-affairs","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-housing-communities-local-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-housing-communities-local-government","base_path":"/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-housing-communities-local-government","content_id":"87779e9b-11a9-402a-9c4d-94dfa892f785","details":{"body":"<p>The Secretary of State has strategic oversight of the Department’s business and policy including: </p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Housing and planning </li>\n  <li>Local government and English devolution </li>\n  <li>Regional and local growth </li>\n  <li>Communities and faith </li>\n  <li>Democracy and elections</li>\n  <li>Building safety and remediation  </li>\n  <li>Public Appointments  </li>\n  <li>Planning casework </li>\n  <li>Corporate </li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":18,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-14T14:46:16Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-housing-communities-local-government","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/minister-for-the-civil-service","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/minister-for-the-civil-service","base_path":"/government/ministers/minister-for-the-civil-service","content_id":"846a7351-c0f1-11e4-8223-005056011aef","details":{"body":"<p>The Minister for the Civil Service is responsible for regulating the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"http://www.civilservice.gov.uk/\">Civil Service</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The <a rel=\"external\" href=\"http://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/1992/61/contents\">Civil Service (Management Functions) Act of 1992</a>, allows the Minister for the Civil Service to delegate power to other ministers and devolved administrations.</p>\n\n<p>This role was created in 1968 and is always held by the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/prime-minister\">Prime Minister</a>.</p>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":3,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2022-09-28T11:40:15Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Minister for the Civil Service","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-for-the-civil-service","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/housing-local-and-community/high-streets-and-town-centres","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/housing-local-and-community/high-streets-and-town-centres","base_path":"/housing-local-and-community/high-streets-and-town-centres","content_id":"b7558ad9-32cf-4d77-92e6-e926fc515e72","details":{"internal_name":"High streets and town centres [P] (level 3, housing theme)","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/business-and-industry/uk-economy","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/business-and-industry/uk-economy","base_path":"/business-and-industry/uk-economy","content_id":"a1e4659c-dc15-48be-bc4f-6c609ae061dc","details":{"internal_name":"UK economy","notes_for_editors":"...","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/business-and-industry","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/business-and-industry","base_path":"/business-and-industry","content_id":"495afdb6-47be-4df1-8b38-91c8adb1eefc","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"Business and industry","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":true},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"root_taxon":[{"api_path":"/api/content/","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/","base_path":"/","content_id":"f3bbdec2-0e62-4520-a7fd-6ffd5d36e03a","document_type":"homepage","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-18T13:00:23Z","schema_name":"homepage","title":"GOV.UK homepage","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2018-09-03T15:41:02Z","schema_name":"taxon","title":"Business and industry","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/business-and-industry","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2018-09-03T15:41:06Z","schema_name":"taxon","title":"UK economy","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/business-and-industry/uk-economy","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2018-08-22T12:54:44Z","schema_name":"taxon","title":"High streets and town centres","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/housing-local-and-community/high-streets-and-town-centres","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2026-06-08T13:48:59+01:00","publishing_app":"whitehall","publishing_request_id":"21-1780922939.329-10.13.20.64-2417","publishing_scheduled_at":null,"rendering_app":"frontend","scheduled_publishing_delay_seconds":null,"schema_name":"news_article","title":"Cheers! Football fans to raise a glass for the World Cup","updated_at":"2026-08-20T13:25:23+01:00","withdrawn_notice":{}}